            "notes": "### **TLDR:**\n- [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power)\n- [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed)\n- Survivability\n\n---\n\n[Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) and [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) will help us up our [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) and [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) even more, with the former even giving us an extra 10% [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) for 3s when healing an ally. If you can afford to, I suggest keeping any of the common items you bought in round 1.\n\nIf you have enough money to afford another rare item, I suggest getting one of the following:\n- [Mid-Air Mobilizer](item_760c1441-8cfa-426c-885d-8d0dec32e145) *for extra [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) and [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) whilst airborne.*\n- [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) *if you are getting shot at a lot*\n- [Angeleisure Wear](item_00b53ed7-0768-442b-a2c3-8d19608c9391) *for more consistent self-healing*",
