            "notes": "###  **TLDR:**\n- Normal -> [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4), [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124), [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power)\n- Exception (Taking big burst damage) -> [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9), [Long Distance Wings](item_8b4bafad-c8bc-4c77-bbe7-798b03920c88), [Ability Power](stat_ability_power)\n\n---\n\n###  NORMALLY\n---\n\n[Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) synergizes amazingly with our first **core** rare item: [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124). While it \"only\" gives you 15% [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power), it basically increases to 30% when healing someone below 50% health.\n\n\nAs for filler items, ideally keep anything you can afford from round 2, with your priority item being [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) so you don't lose out on too much [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed).\n\n**DISCLAIMER:** From this point on the build will proceed following the \"NORMAL\" route. If you need to know what to upgrade for [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9), skip to round 5.\n\n\n---\n###  EMERGENCY\n---\nIf your team is in **desperate** need of burst healing, you can get [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9) early along with the following items:\n\n- [Long Distance Wings](item_8b4bafad-c8bc-4c77-bbe7-798b03920c88) *longer [Guardian Angel](ability_5132a6c2-1b20-4776-9273-73d49e2d145a) range*\n- [Angeleisure Wear](item_00b53ed7-0768-442b-a2c3-8d19608c9391)  *independent survivability*\n- [Aerodynamic Feathers](item_03d95229-b91d-48c0-b1e3-c8075b678ef0)  *incresing [Move Speed](stat_move_speed) up to 60% during Angelic Descent*\n- [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) *[Ability Power](stat_ability_power) and [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power)*\n- [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) and [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) *cheap [Ability Power](stat_ability_power)*",
