            "notes": "### **TLDR:**\n- [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124)\n- [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48)\n- [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power), [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed), Survivability\n\n---\n\nThe second **core** item is [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) which gives a tasty 20% [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) along with 10% [Move Speed](stat_move_speed) for 2s whenever you use an ability. This now allows you to sell [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) since it is no longer your highest priority. [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) would be the better choice here, since you still get the 10% [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) from healing allies.\n\n---\nAs for filler items, you can use the same ones from round 3, though they are listed here again. Me personally, I suggest [Angeleisure Wear](item_00b53ed7-0768-442b-a2c3-8d19608c9391) for survivability or [Mid-Air Mobilizer](item_760c1441-8cfa-426c-885d-8d0dec32e145) if you're doing fine on the surviving front.",
