            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-23T14:04:01.107545+00:00",
            "notes": "### **TLDR:**\n- [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9)\n- [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5)\n- [Long Distance Wings](item_8b4bafad-c8bc-4c77-bbe7-798b03920c88)\n- [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b)\n- [Blessed Boosters](item_957fd380-b7b4-40d4-8333-bb8c535ca931) or [Aerodynamic Feathers](item_03d95229-b91d-48c0-b1e3-c8075b678ef0)\n\n---\n\nThe way you need to adjust your playstyle now is very simple: ***Become the Slingshot***. Use your [Guardian Angel](ability_5132a6c2-1b20-4776-9273-73d49e2d145a) to either hop between allies or get *as much distance* as you can between you and your team, so that when you next use [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9), the burst heal gets used to its **max potential**.\n\n---\n\n### First: ***SELL EVERYTHING.***\nIt is **so much easier** to start with an empty slate than to go item by item buying and selling as you need. We want to see just how many credits we have to work with.\n\n---\nFor [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9), the items you need are simple:\n\n- [Long Distance Wings](item_8b4bafad-c8bc-4c77-bbe7-798b03920c88)\n- [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5)\n- [Aerodynamic Feathers](item_03d95229-b91d-48c0-b1e3-c8075b678ef0)\n-> [Blessed Boosters](item_957fd380-b7b4-40d4-8333-bb8c535ca931) ( *if you can afford it* )\n- [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b)\n\nThese are your **must-haves**, anything else depends on your *needs* and your *budget*.\n\n---\nSurvivability:\n\n- [Angeleisure Wear](item_00b53ed7-0768-442b-a2c3-8d19608c9391)\n- [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016)\n- [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6)\n\n[Ability Power](stat_ability_power):\n\n- [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2)\n- [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)\n- [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295)\n\n[Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power):\n\n- [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e)\n- [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054)\n- [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)",
