            "created_at": "2025-09-23T14:04:01.107545+00:00",
            "notes": "### **TLDR:**\n- [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5)\n- [Long Distance Wings](item_8b4bafad-c8bc-4c77-bbe7-798b03920c88)\n- [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b)\n- [Blessed Boosters](item_957fd380-b7b4-40d4-8333-bb8c535ca931)\n- [Ability Power](stat_ability_power), [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power), Survivability\n\n---\n\nRound 5 gave you the chance to see what you need balancing on now that you have shifted your main focus from weapon healing to burst healing and movement. Most of the time you will notice your Staff healing now severely lacking the impact it had before, which is fixable!\n\n---\n\n[Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) our old friend rejoins the team for the tasty 15% [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) (up to 30%) it gives us. \n\nAlternatively this can be swapped for [Caduceus EX](item_9e7965ea-2abc-44a7-b042-950c6ad2fce7) which may only give 10% [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power), but increases your Staff Range by 33% which - trust me - makes a difference.\n\n---\nIf you haven't already, now is the time to swap [Aerodynamic Feathers](item_03d95229-b91d-48c0-b1e3-c8075b678ef0) for [Blessed Boosters](item_957fd380-b7b4-40d4-8333-bb8c535ca931). This is *more important* than being able to afford a different epic item.",
